<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc1">JUDE Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDE</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Jude renga Lekha muthuon</char> hih iempungei intia, minchupu dikloingei doia inningna ranga miziek ani. Hima lekhamuthuon bongkik sûnga chong aom <char style="bk">Peter inikna</char> leh inphuona tak dônna a miziekpu'n a porengei, “Pathien'n voikhata a mingei ranga a pêksai taksônna le anrêngin an doi ranga mohôkna ani.”</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmaruoi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nunchan, minchuna, le minchupu dikloingei inmangna <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Taksônna sûrmindet tit ranga mohôkna <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Satvurchubai <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mk 6:3</ref></char>
    </note> Jude, Jisua Khrista tîrlâm, le Jacob lâibungpa renga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Pathien'n a koi pungei, Pa Pathien lungkhamna sûnga omngei le Jisua Khrista rungna ngei han:<verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Mulungjûrpuina, inngêina le lungkhamna ngei ha ninta rangin sipmatin om rese.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minchupu dikloingei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Ko moroitak ka malngei, ei renga ei chang inruol Sanminringna chungroi hih nin kôma miziek rangin ke theidôr ku pût lâiin, Pathien'n a mingei taksônna voikhata a pêksai ngei le anrêngin nin doi rangin nangni mohôkna miziek rangin anângin ki riet ani. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Mi senkhat Pathien dônloi mingei inrûka ei lâia lût an oma, ha mingei han ei Pathien moroina chungroi hah hurna lampui an minchanga, ei Puma le Pumapa. Jisua Khrista ei dôntie khom an hengpai ani, Ha mingei han theiloi an chang rangtie chu tienlâi renga Pathien lekhabu'n alei muphuong sai kêng ani zoi.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Jôk 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:29">Tel 14:29</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 14:30">30</ref></char>
    </note> Hima ngei murdi hih nin lei riet sai nikhomsenla, nangni min riet nôk ku nuom Pumapa'n <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pumapa'n</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; senkhat ngei miziek chu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jisua, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tin an dônna Greek chongin </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Joshua </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tina leh munkhat ani.</char></note> Isrealngei ha Egypt ram renga a kêlsuo ngeia, aniatachu a iemloi pungei chu nûka ala minmang ngei nôk ani. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Vântîrtonngei khom an rachamneina sinthotheina azotordor sûnga omloia, an omna mun mâk ngei chu Pathien'n Nikhuo inlaltaka theiloi minchang rangin kumtuong zingjirûia thungin ijîng nuoia, a dar ngei ani tih riettit roi. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Sodom le Gomorrah le akôl revêla khopuingeia mingei khom ha vântîrtonngei sintho angdêna tho hur le ngala nunchan saloia an inpêk sikin mitin inrimna rangin kumtuong meia dûkmintongin ânlangiemin aom tih riettit roi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Aph 19:1-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Ma angdên han, ha mingei han inlârnangei an mua, mangei sika han an takpum an min nima; Pathien rachamneina an mumâka, male chungtienga roiinpuitaka aom ngei khom an êro ani. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Vântîrton ânchungtak Michael luon mahi tho mak, Diabol le Moses ruok tumo achang rang an inchua an inkhal lâihan, Michael'n Diabol hah chongsie rokôk ngam maka, “Pumapa'n nang la ngo rese!” a ti pe ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Chph 12:7</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:6">Bal 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zak 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Aniatachu hi mingei hin i-ih khom an riet theiloi chu doiin an êro ngâia; male mindona dônloi ramsa ngei angin an suokpu neinunngei rietna han anni ngei hah asietminmang ngâi. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Anni rangin idôra chi-om mo ani zoi! Cain lampui hah an jûia, sum sikin Balaam sietna a lei thona tieng anninâkin an inpêk zoi. Korah ânhel anghan an inhela, male ama angin an inmang zoi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Aph 4:3-8</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Tel 22:1-35</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Tel 16:1-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Anni ngei hah nin inlopkhômna bukhalâi ôtna han an inzakloina hah sabê ânnim angin anni. Anninanâk rang vai mindon ngâi an ni. Anni ngei ha ruotui pomloi sûmngei phâivuon a sêmpai angin an ni. Anni ngei hah thingkung inra zora luo inra ngâiloi, thingkung rujungngei phôi paia oma athipa angin an ni. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Anni ngei hah tuikhangliena tuidârinsok angin, an sintho inzakpui omngei hah tuihuon minlang angin an ni. Anni ngei hah ârsingei chaititir angin Pathien'n ijîng inthûktak sûnga tuonsôta om ranga mun a hôih pe ngei ani.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Maha Enoch, Adam renga richisuonpâr sarina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">sarina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hi number hih anruonin masatak le anûktaka minlûtsan adônte'n Adam renga Enoch tena riming sari ngei ani. (Miziek senkhatngei chu uruk tiin an dôn).</char></note> hi tienlâi han dêipu chongin alei misîr sai: “Pumapa ha a vântîrton inthieng isâng tamtak ngei leh a juong rang <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:18">Aph 5:18</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>Mi murdi chunga roijêkna juong min tungin, Pathien adônloingei sintho murdi le Pathien dônloi mi nunsiengei ama dôia chonghoiloitak an ti sika theiloi minchang rangin!”<verse eid="JUD 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Hi mingei hi chu zoratin an chiera, midangngei theiloi an mintuma; an ôina saloingei an jûia, an thethenin an insonga male an man rang aomin chu midangngei an minpâk tatak ngâi ani.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inningnangei le rilnangei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Aniatachu, Ku ruolngei, zora vunsaia ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista tîrtonngeiin nangni an rilngei hah riettit roi. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>“Sûn nûktak ngei ahong tung le chu, Pathien dônloi mingeiin an ôinangei innimngei jûiin, nangni phengsan rang mi an la hong inlang rang,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2 Pet 3:3</ref></char></note> nangni an tipe hah. <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Hi mingei hin insenna sin ngâi, an taksa ôinangei jêka om pungei, Ratha dônloipu ngei an ni. <verse eid="JUD 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Aniatachu, nangni ku ruolngei, nin taksônna inthiengtak chunga han nin thethenin sin inding roi. Ratha Inthieng sinthotheina han chubaitho roi, <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>male ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista inriengmuna han kumtuong ringna nangni a pêk rang hah ngâkin Pathien lungkhamna sûnga han om roi.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Mulung okchâna adônpungei chunga han inriengmuna minlang ungla; <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>midangngei hah mei renga kailitin sanminjôk ungla; ichi pumin lungkhamna minlang ungla, aniatachu an sietna ôina saloi kop puon innim ngei hah chu heng roi.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minpâkna chubaithona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Nin inlet loina ranga nangni donsûi theipu le roiinpuitaka amakunga demnaboia râisântaka nangni dar theipu <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>mi Sanminringpu Pathien kôm vai han Jisua Khrista ei Pumapa jâra zora vunsai murdi, atûn le tuonsôt tuonsôtin roiinpuina, inlalna, ratna, sinthotheina, le rachamneina ngei om tit rese! Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
